    {
      "source": "Obtain the data as <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/io/InputStream.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.io\"><code>InputStream</code></a>. <br/>\n<strong>NOTE:</strong> Buffers data in memory. Use <a href=\"#getDownloadStream()\"><code>getDownloadStream()</code></a> for large files.",
