    {
      "source": "Reactive <code>GridFSFile</code> based <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/Resource.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>Resource</code></a> implementation. Note that the <a href=\"#getDownloadStream()\"><code>content</code></a>\ncan be consumed only once.",
      "translation": "基于响应式 <code>GridFSFile</code> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/Resource.html\" title=\"org.springframework.core.io 中的类或接口\"><code>Resource</code></a> 实现。请注意，<a href=\"#getDownloadStream()\"><code>content</code></a> 只能被消费一次。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
